>> source: made up for the tests
>> time required: 15 minutes

Toast @pine nuts{2-3%tbsp} in #pan{} for ~{2%minutes}. \
Watch them closely.

Blend @basil{2%cups}, @garlic{1-2%cloves}, @parmesan{1/2%cup} and the pine nuts.
Add @olive oil{1/3%cup} slowly -- or a bit more
while blending.

Season with @salt and @lemon juice{1/2%tsp}.
